#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/chapter.rst:2
msgid "Use of WFS in MapServer"
msgstr "WFS在MapServer中的使用"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/chapter.rst:4
msgid ""
"We can easily get the map in the specified area from the WMS server, but "
"we can only get the rendered map. Sometimes we want to get data such as "
"the geographical coordinates and attributes of a specified layer, and "
"further, when we need to modify the data of the data source, WMS can not "
"meet the needs."
msgstr "我们可以很容易地从WMS服务器获取指定区域的地图，但我们只能获得渲染的地图。有时我们想要得到指定图层的地理坐标和属性等数据，进一步地，当我们需要修改数据源的数据时，WMS无法满足需要。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/chapter.rst:10
msgid ""
"However, you can also send data from the Web service to the client upon "
"request. As long as the server and the client follow the same "
"specification, the data can be in any format. In order to standardize the"
" process of sending vector data through Web services, OGC provides us "
"with another standard Web Feature Service (WFS) to meet the above "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"但是，您也可以根据请求将数据从Web服务发送到客户端。只要服务器和客户端遵循相同的规范，数据就可以是任何格式。为了规范通过Web服务发送矢量数据的过程，OGC提供了另一种标准的Web"
" Feature Service(WFS)来满足上述要求。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/chapter.rst:17
msgid ""
"Next, we will introduce the release, access and application of WFS and "
"its services."
msgstr "接下来，我们将介绍WFS及其服务的发布、访问和应用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:4
msgid "Geographic Web Services"
msgstr "地理Web服务"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"MapServer publishing services are configured through Mapfile, and WFS "
"services are no exception. Similar to configuring WMS, to publish WFS, "
"add key-value pairs about WFS in the METADATA section of the Mapfile "
"configuration file. MapServer will only include WFS functionality if the "
"layer meets the following conditions:"
msgstr "MapServer发布服务是通过Mapfile配置的，WFS服务也不例外。与配置WMS类似，要发布WFS，请在映射文件配置文件的元数据部分添加关于WFS的键-值对。只有在图层满足以下条件时，MapServer才会包含WFS功能："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:12
msgid "The data source is vector data: shapefile, OGR, Postgis, sde    (ArcSDE);"
msgstr "数据源为矢量数据：Shapefile、OGR、Postgis、SDE(ArcSDE)；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:13
msgid "Layer name must be set;"
msgstr "必须设置层名称；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:14
msgid ""
"The layer data space type must be one of ``point`` , ``line`` ,    "
"``polygon``;"
msgstr "图层数据空间类型必须为以下类型之一  ``point`` ，  ``line`` ，  ``polygon`` ；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:15
msgid "``wfs_onlineresource`` and ``wfs_enable_request`` must be set."
msgstr "``wfs_onlineresource`` 和  ``wfs_enable_request`` 必须设置。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:17
msgid ""
"MapServer itself can be configured to support WFS, and you can also use "
"TinyOWS. Using TinyOWS can support WFS-T and realize the function of "
"online editing and saving."
msgstr "MapServer本身可以配置为支持WFS，您也可以使用TinyOWS。使用TinyOWS可以支持WFS-T，并实现在线编辑和保存功能。"

