msgstr "根据发布的WMS的映射文件配置，添加WFS配置。以下是配置了WMS和WFS的Mapfile实例。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:28
msgid "Mapfile is as follows:"
msgstr "映射文件如下："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:35
msgid ""
"Compared with the Mapfile that only configures WMS, the main change lies "
"in the METADATA sub-object of the MAP object and the METADATA sub-object "
"of the LAYER object. In the METADATA of the MAP object, the added key-"
"value pairs include:"
msgstr "与只配置WMS的映射文件相比，主要的变化在于地图对象的元数据子对象和Layer对象的元数据子对象。在映射对象的元数据中，添加的键值对包括："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:40
msgid ""
"``wfs_title`` , required, returned in the ``GetCapabilities`` request as "
"the ``title`` element of the XML document in the service response;"
msgstr "``wfs_title`` ，必填，在  ``GetCapabilities`` 请求作为  ``title`` 服务响应中的XML文档的元素；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:42
msgid "``wfs_onlineresource``, required, provide the server address of ``wfs``;"
msgstr "``wfs_onlineresource`` ，提供的服务器地址为  ``wfs`` ；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:44
msgid ""
"``wfs_srs``, the spatial reference system of the data (Spatial Reference "
"System);"
msgstr "``wfs_srs`` 数据的空间参照系(空间参照系)；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:46
msgid ""
"``wfs_abstract`` , returned by the ``Abstract`` element of the XML "
"document in the ``GetCapabilities`` request as the service response;"
msgstr ""
"``wfs_abstract`` ，由  ``Abstract`` 元素中的XML文档的  ``GetCapabilities`` "
"请求作为服务响应；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:48
msgid ""
"``wfs_enable_request``, which means to configure MapServer map to support"
" all operations of ``wfs`` globally."
msgstr "``wfs_enable_request`` ，这意味着要将MapServer地图配置为支持  ``wfs`` 全球范围内。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:51
msgid ""
"The key-value pair added to the METADATA of the LAYER object is as "
"follows (Note: There are many repetitions of the METADATA of the "
"configuration and the MAP object. If it is not set, the METADATA "
"configuration of the MAP object will be inherited. If it is set, the "
"configuration of the LAYER will be used, which is in a MAP Useful when "
"the object contains multiple layers):"
msgstr "添加到Layer对象的元数据的键值对如下(注：配置和地图对象的元数据有很多重复。如果不设置，将继承地图对象的元数据配置。如果设置了该值，将使用该层的配置，当对象包含多个层时，该配置在地图中非常有用)："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:58
msgid ""
"``wfs_title`` , returned by the ``title`` element of the XML document in "
"the ``GetCapabilities`` request as the service’s response;"
msgstr "``wfs_title`` ，由  ``title`` 元素中的XML文档的  ``GetCapabilities`` 请求作为服务的响应；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:60
msgid "``wfs_srs``, the Spatial Reference System of the data;"
msgstr "``wfs_srs`` 数据的空间参考系；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:61
msgid ""
"``gml_featureid`` , the attribute name of the feature ID corresponding to"
" the layer;"
msgstr "``gml_featureid`` ，该层对应的特征ID的属性名称；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec01_intro/section.rst:63
msgid ""
"``wfs_enable_request`` , configures the layer to support all wfs "
"operations."
msgstr "``wfs_enable_request`` 将层配置为支持所有WFS操作。"

