msgstr "WFS服务返回数据(或要素)，而不是地图。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb6_mapserver-wfs/sec03_via-leaflet1/section.rst:7
msgid ""
"Returning data means more information. Users can parse information to "
"accomplish more complex tasks. But it also means that the task of drawing"
" is left to the client, which requires more coding work."
msgstr "返回数据意味着更多信息。用户可以解析信息以完成更复杂的任务。但这也意味着绘图的任务留给了客户端，这需要更多的编码工作。"

